'''Budget Setup''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|grandmaster combat achievement]] which requires the player to kill [[TzKal-Zuk]] without using a [[twisted bow]] for the entire [[Inferno]] run.

==Strategy==
Effective alternative ranged weapons to the twisted bow include the [[bow of Faerdhinen]] or [[Zaryte crossbow]] along with a [[toxic blowpipe]]. Using a [[Tumeken's shadow]] (optionally with an [[Eye of Ayak]]) is also viable, although care must be taken due to the lower defences of magic armour.

